<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="title">完整培训记录确认</text><text class="muted">签字表示本人已查看本次培训的学习内容和考试结果。正式提交后本人不可覆盖。</text></view><view class="sign-box"><canvas canvas-id="signature" disable-scroll="true" bindtouchstart="start" bindtouchmove="move"></canvas><text wx:if="{{!touched}}" class="hint">请在此处手写签名</text></view><view class="row"><button class="secondary half" bindtap="clear">清空重签</button><button class="secondary half" bindtap="preview">提交前预览</button></view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">确认并正式提交</button><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view>
